    "title": "Opinion: Don't Take The E-Tabs Machine To The Bathroom - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Opinion: Don’t Take The E-Tabs Machine To The Bathroom\nBy Paul Shea,\n1 hours agoI was out to eat recently, and someone I was eating with nudged me to make me aware that someone in the restaurant/bar area was walking around with their e-tabs tablet. Sure enough, this player was taking a bathroom break, and they ended up taking the tablet to the bathroom with them. Yuck.",
